%83%E7%B4%A0%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%89%80%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E6%9B%B4%E5%A5%BD%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1631267373863\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/73514954/04b934ad1828f72f988bf62aae2192bf_5668167047973821924.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">四星骑枪，其本身也是相对通用的，武器技能是标准的骑枪技能，无消耗控制敌人并造成高倍率的伤害，而其成功使用武器技能之后可以给予角色20%的全伤害提升，持续15秒。通用的效果作为唯一的一把四星骑枪很好的起到了前期过渡的作用，但是因为其武器技能造成的是物理伤害，故物理角色在使用时会比元素角色使用所得到的效果相对更好。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/73514954/04b934ad1828f72f988bf62aae2192bf_5668167047973821924.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
